"新上传设置尚未成功更新。旧日期或字段的云端内容可能仍可访问；请先重试已确认的设置，再创建新链接。" = "The new upload settings have not been applied successfully. Cloud content using previous dates or fields may remain accessible. Retry the confirmed settings before creating new links.";
"有来源等待恢复创建。请在上传日历中选择原日历，核对已确认的上传设置后重试。" = "A source is awaiting creation recovery. Choose the original calendar in upload settings, review the confirmed scope, and retry.";
"查看已确认的共享范围" = "View confirmed sharing scope";
"此来源尚未关联到本机日历。若无法恢复原上传设置，可删除这份云端来源后重新创建。" = "This source is not linked to a calendar on this device. If its original upload settings cannot be recovered, delete the cloud source and create it again.";
