"修改日期或补全未完成的上传设置，会执行一次明确确认的同步，即使这台设备原来暂停上传也会执行；之后仍保持暂停。失败时旧日期或字段的内容可能仍可访问，已确认的设置会保留以便重试。" = "Changing dates or completing unfinished upload settings runs one explicitly confirmed sync, even if uploads on this device are paused. Uploads remain paused afterward. If it fails, content using previous dates or fields may remain accessible; the confirmed settings are kept for retry.";
